    <section class="card-header">

        <div class="number">
            MAJOR ARCANA • 0
        </div>

        <h1>
            THE FOOL
        </h1>

        <div class="subtitle">
            The beginning. The unknown. The leap.
        </div>

    </section>

    <div class="card-symbol">

        <div class="symbol-inner">

            <div class="symbol">
                ✦
            </div>

            <div class="symbol-text">
                THE FOOL
            </div>

        </div>

    </div>

    <section class="content">

        <div class="panel">

            <h2>
                THE ESSENCE
            </h2>

            <p>
                The Fool represents beginnings, possibility and
                the courage to step into something unknown.
                It is the energy of curiosity before certainty,
                and trust before the entire path is visible.
            </p>

            <div class="keywords">
                Beginnings • Freedom • Trust • Possibility
            </div>

        </div>

        <div class="panel">

            <h2>
                UPRIGHT
            </h2>

            <p>
                You may be standing at the edge of a new chapter.
                The invitation is to remain open, curious and
                willing to take the first step without needing
                every answer beforehand.
            </p>

        </div>

        <div class="panel">

            <h2>
                REVERSED
            </h2>

            <p>
                The Fool reversed can suggest hesitation,
                impulsiveness or stepping forward without
                considering what you truly need. Pause and ask
                whether you are acting from trust or avoidance.
            </p>

        </div>

        <div class="panel">

            <h2>
                REFLECTION
            </h2>

            <p>
                What would you begin if you did not need
                to know exactly where it would lead?
            </p>

        </div>

    </section>

